Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.50,0:03:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第2季第10集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.12,0:00:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸要我们继承他的遗志{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad wants us to pick up where he left off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.04,0:00:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,救助他人 猎杀恶魔 家族事业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving people, hunting things, the family business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.13,0:00:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道关于萨姆 和其他孩子的秘密了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the truth about Sammy and the other children?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.01,0:00:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 已经有段日子了 - 爸爸 那个魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've known for a while. - Dad, you know the demon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.64,0:00:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,说对我和跟我一样的孩子们早有安排{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he had plans for me and children like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他是什么意思吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what he meant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.81,0:00:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟你说了什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he say anything to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.31,0:00:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克斯 你的能力是从六七个月前开始的 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max, your abilities they started six, seven months ago, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.65,0:00:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道？- 我的也是那时开始的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How'd you know? - That's when mine started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.11,0:00:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我 我们是被选中的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I were chosen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.07,0:00:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为了什么？- 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For what? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.08,0:00:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们每个都可能杀人 每一个 也许这就是魔鬼想要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's capable of murder. That's what the demon's doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼迫我们 千方百计让我们崩溃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pushing us to break us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.79,0:00:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不知道那魔鬼想要什么呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know what the demon wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.62,0:00:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们都有某种能力 - 能力？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We all have some kind of ability. - Ability?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,某种超自然的能力 我能看到幻觉 或者说前兆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psychic ability. I have visions, premonitions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.80,0:00:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟别人的都不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's different for everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个魔鬼说他对我们这样的人有所安排{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon said he had plans for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.30,0:00:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的安排？我们不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What kind of plans? - I don't really know for sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.06,0:01:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害怕 斯科特 你可以告诉我一切 你知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid, Scott. You can tell me anything, you know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.52,0:01:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你说了什么 都仅限于你我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you say won't leave this room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.11,0:01:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是一年多前开始的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It started a little over a year ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.99,0:01:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是偏头疼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Migraines at first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.91,0:01:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就发现我干些事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I found I could do stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.33,0:01:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,「干些事」是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "do stuff"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.33,0:01:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一种能力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have this ability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我想的话 我能电死我所接触的任何东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I touch something, I can electrocute it if I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.67,0:01:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.43,0:01:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在邻居家的猫身上试过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it to the neighbor's cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.43,0:01:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的内脏被电成了烤汉堡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its insides fried up like a hamburger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.19,0:01:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你是当真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe that you believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:01:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.24,0:02:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想握下吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna shake on it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.21,0:02:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特 你为什么要杀死邻居的猫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you want to kill the neighbor's cat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.67,0:02:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.13,0:02:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我干的 还不准我停下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants me to. And he doesn't want me to stop there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.89,0:02:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.10,0:02:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄眼睛的男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The yellow-eyed man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.89,0:02:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在我的梦里出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He comes to me in my dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.18,0:02:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我干那些事 可怕的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tells me to do things. Awful things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.27,0:02:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我拒绝了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I tell him no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.11,0:02:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.90,0:02:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄眼睛的人还说了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else does the yellow-eyed man tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.83,0:02:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他… 他说他对我有某种安排 什么样的安排？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He has plans for me. - What kind of plans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.90,0:04:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸死前 他 他告诉了我一些事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before Dad died, he… He told me something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.99,0:04:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.91,0:04:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 他跟你说了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what did he tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that he…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我看好你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}wanted me to watch out for you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.09,0:04:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}take care of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这话他都说过很多遍了 - 但这次不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He told you that a million times. - This time was different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.89,0:04:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我得…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that I had to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.93,0:04:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,挽救你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}save you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save me from what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.14,0:04:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就说我得救你 别的都无关紧要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just said that I had to save you. That nothing else mattered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不能 我就…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that if I couldn't, I'd{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.02,0:04:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就怎么样 迪恩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd what, Dean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.19,0:04:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就得杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have to kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.41,0:04:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我也许不得不杀了你 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that I might have to kill you, Sammy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.29,0:04:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.54,0:04:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这话什么意思？- 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell's that supposed to mean? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有什么原因他才这么说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must've had some reason for saying it, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.92,0:05:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道那个魔鬼对我的安排是什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he know the demon's plans for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.59,0:05:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会站到邪恶一方还是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I supposed to go dark side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.26,0:05:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还跟你说了什么 迪恩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else did he say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.55,0:05:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这些了 我发誓 - 你为什么不告诉我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing, I swear. - How could you not have told me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为老爸求我不要告诉你 - 我不管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was Dad. He begged me not to. - Who cares?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.97,0:05:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也别想逃避责任 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take some responsibility for yourself, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.27,0:05:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你凭什么瞒着我 - 你以为我愿意？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You had no right to keep this from me. - You think I wanted this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.23,0:05:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒希望他从没这么讲过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish to God he'd never opened his mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.28,0:05:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我的脑子 就不用天天想着它了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I wouldn't have to walk around with this screaming in my head all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.87,0:05:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得搞清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just gotta figure out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.29,0:05:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是怎么回事 还有这话是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's going on then, what the hell all this means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.71,0:05:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.59,0:05:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想过了 我们应该避一阵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been thinking about this. I think we should just lay low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少是这段时间 这样安全点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least for a while. Be safer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.43,0:05:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样我就能搞清楚… - 搞清楚什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And that way I can make sure. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.68,0:05:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会变成魔鬼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I don't turn evil?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.31,0:05:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还是我不会变成杀人凶手？- 我没这么说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That I don't turn into a killer? - I never said that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.77,0:05:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪迪恩 你要是不小心点的话 说不定哪天会被我杀了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not careful, you will have to waste me one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没这么说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never said that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.02,0:06:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 萨姆 事情全乱套了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole thing is spinning out of control, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.15,0:06:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对那些莫名其妙的魔鬼病毒免疫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're immune to some weirdo demon virus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.78,0:06:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道该怎么办了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't even know what the hell anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.37,0:06:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你生我的气 我知道 没关系 我活该{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pissed at me and I get it. That's fine. I deserve it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.21,0:06:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但咱们应该避避风头 想想该怎么办 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we lay low until we figure out our next move, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.17,0:06:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 求你了 嘿 求求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, please, man. Hey, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给我点时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me some time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我好好想想 好吗？算我求你了 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me some time to think, okay? I'm begging you. Please, man, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.83,0:09:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.42,0:09:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.29,0:09:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 只是又做了一个恶梦 我很好 没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I just had another nightmare. It's fine, it's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.63,0:09:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 继续睡吧 - 你确定？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just go back to sleep. - Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.68,0:09:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 那好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.16,0:09:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 - 嗨 埃伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam. - Hey, Ellen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.83,0:09:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到我好象一点不吃惊 - 你哥哥打过电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't seem surprised to see me. - Your brother's calling. Worried sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在到处找你 - 我就知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Looking for you. - Yeah, I figured he might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on between you two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.18,0:10:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.39,0:10:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how's Jo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.18,0:10:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可不知道 - 什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I don't really know. - What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好几星期没见过她了 她有时候寄个明信片什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen her in weeks. She sends a postcard now and again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.90,0:10:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.19,0:10:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次和你们俩猎鬼之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, after she worked that job with you boys…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就决定继续干下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}she decided she wanted to keep on hunting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.70,0:10:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉她在我眼皮底下想都别想 她就说 好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, "Not under my roof." And she said, "Fine."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.87,0:10:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我是你现在最不想看到的人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm probably the last person you wanna see right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.87,0:10:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 别误会了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't get me wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.25,0:10:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望能怪在你们头上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could blame the hell out of you boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样能让我轻松些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be easier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.59,0:10:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,可事实是 不是你们的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is, it's not your fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.84,0:10:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.89,0:10:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都没有错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}none of it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.22,0:10:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to know that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.10,0:10:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很久以前就原谅你们的爸爸了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgave your daddy a long time ago…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.73,0:10:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for what happened to my Bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.11,0:10:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是不能原谅自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't think he ever forgave himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.74,0:11:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.95,0:11:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 那你来这儿有什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um. So why did you come here, sweetie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.95,0:11:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.75,0:11:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我找什么 萨姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I looking for, Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.55,0:11:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人… 其他跟我一样有超能力的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other people…Other psychics like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,越多越好 我要你在全国范围内找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As many as possible. And I need a nationwide search.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.92,0:11:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我以为不可能都找到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I thought there was no way to track them all down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是所有的都和你一样 在婴儿时遭遇过火灾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of them had nursery fires like you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 不过有些是的 就从他们开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no, but some had to. Start there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.15,0:11:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 搞定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done and done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.61,0:11:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真够快的 - 当然了 我就是干这个的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was fast. - Well, apparently, that's my job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.19,0:11:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,小意思了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a monkey dance at the keyboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.41,0:11:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说你找到什么了 阿什{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell us what you got, Ash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.16,0:11:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,全国共有四个符合要求的家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four folks fit the profile, nationwide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.79,0:11:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,出生于1983 母亲在婴儿时就死于火灾 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Born in '83. Mother died in a nursery fire, the whole shebang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,4个？就这些？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four? That's it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.17,0:11:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,堪萨斯州劳伦斯的萨姆·温彻斯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester from Lawrence, Kansas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.79,0:11:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,密歇根萨吉诺的马克斯·米勒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max Miller from Saginaw, Michigan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:12:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄克拉荷马州格斯里的安得烈·加拉赫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrew Gallagher from Guthrie, Oklahoma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.97,0:12:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个 斯库特·凯里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, another name, Scott Carey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？你有地址吗？- 算是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got an address? - Kind of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.31,0:12:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第安纳州拉法叶的阿伯山公墓 486号墓室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Arbor Hills Cemetery in Lafayette, Indiana. Plot 486.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.56,0:12:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他死了？- 大约一个月以前被杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So he's dead? - Killed about a month ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么死的？- 被捅死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Killed how? - Stabbed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.49,0:12:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在停车场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a parking lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.49,0:12:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,条子们没找到什么线索 没有嫌疑人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuzz don't have much. No suspects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.08,0:12:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.54,0:12:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去哪儿？- 印第安纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - Indiana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.55,0:12:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.09,0:12:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得告诉迪恩 我得让他知道你在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta call Dean, let him know where you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.51,0:12:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃伦 我要知道我到底是什么人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen, I'm trying to find answers about who I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.01,0:12:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我哥哥… 他是好意 可是他没法保护我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother means well, but he can't protect me from that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.86,0:13:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你和斯科特是高中同学？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you went to high school with Scott?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 是的 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh. Yes, sir, I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.61,0:13:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚听说这件事 很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just heard about what happened. I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.91,0:13:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特是个好孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scotty was a good boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.58,0:13:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和你们认识的时候可大不一样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he changed a lot since you knew him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.79,0:13:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概从一年前开始吧 他先是头疼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It started about a year ago with these headaches…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就得了抑郁症 妄想症 还做恶梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then he got depressed, paranoid, nightmares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.21,0:13:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶梦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nightmares?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 他跟你谈起过这些噩梦吗？比如他梦到了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um. Did he ever talk to you about his nightmares? What he saw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.55,0:13:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.22,0:13:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从不告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He closed up on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想帮他 可是没用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to get him help but nothing took.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,整天把自己锁在房间里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lock himself in his room for days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.90,0:13:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看看他的房间吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think maybe I could see his room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.23,0:15:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？- 请别…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.03,0:15:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有危险了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.69,0:15:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道这听起来难以置信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, I know how all this sounds…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.20,0:15:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我既不是疯子也没磕药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm not insane and I'm not on drugs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.99,0:15:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 我很正常 这对我来说也太太奇怪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I'm normal. This is way, way off the map for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.16,0:15:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.16,0:15:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静一点 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just calm down, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.88,0:15:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么名字？- 阿瓦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's your name? - Ava.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.75,0:15:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿瓦？- 阿瓦·威尔森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ava? - Ava Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.17,0:15:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿瓦 我是萨姆·温彻斯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ava, I'm Sam Winchester, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.71,0:15:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在跟我说说你的那些梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you were telling me about these dreams of yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.22,0:15:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是啊 呃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, uh, okay-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.43,0:15:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概一年之前 我开始 头疼 然后就…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a year ago I started having these, like, headaches and just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.06,0:15:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始做恶梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}nightmares, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.35,0:15:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始我根本没多想 直到我梦到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think much of it, until I had this one dream…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.35,0:15:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人在停车场里被刺死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I saw this guy get stabbed in a parking lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么时候的事？- 嗯 大概一个月以前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When was this? - Uh, about a month ago, but anyway-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.86,0:15:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但几天之后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple of days later…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.86,0:15:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.37,0:16:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在几天前我就预见了这个人的死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw this guy die. Days before it happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道是怎么回事 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why, I don't know-It's just, some reason…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.71,0:16:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知为什么 我的梦变成了真事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}my dreams are coming true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.05,0:16:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后昨天晚上 我又做了一个恶梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And last night, I had another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.59,0:16:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后？- 是关于你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - About you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.31,0:16:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么找到我的？- 哦 呃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did you find me? - Oh, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.69,0:16:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿着旅馆的信纸 我就用谷歌找到这个旅馆 是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had motel stationery. And I Googled the motel and it was real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.11,0:16:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我想应该来警告你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so I just thought that I should warn you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.12,0:16:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你当然不信了 总你觉得我是个彻底的神经病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you don't. You think I'm a total nut job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是的 我的意思是 你肯定也是我们中的一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, no, no, no, I mean, you must be one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.29,0:16:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 什么中的一个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. One of-One of who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.21,0:16:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我一样 有超能力的人中的一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the psychics like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.59,0:16:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿瓦 我也能看到预兆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Ava, I have visions too, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:16:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 所以我们之间是有某种关系的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So-So we're connected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.43,0:17:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来… 你才是个疯子 真是太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so you're nuts. That's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.77,0:17:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 你母亲是不是也是死在火灾里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, okay, okay, look, did your mother happen to die in a house fire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.82,0:17:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我妈妈在棕榈海滩活的好好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, my mother lives in Palm Beach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.82,0:17:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你也不是那种模式的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't fit the pattern either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.75,0:17:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我是埃伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - It's Ellen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.66,0:17:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 你有萨姆的消息吗？- 有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, have you heard from Sam? - I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.50,0:17:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他让我发誓不告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he made me promise not to tell you where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.46,0:17:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样埃伦 求你了 也许要出什么大事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Ellen. Something bad could be going on here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.34,0:17:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓要照顾那孩子的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I swore I'd look after that kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.38,0:17:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,俗话说的好 你没法保护你爱的人一辈子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say you can't protect your loved ones forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.18,0:17:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而要我说让它见鬼去 要不还叫什么家人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I say screw that. What else is family for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在印第安娜的拉法叶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in Lafayette, Indiana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.06,0:17:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.65,0:17:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛不在被炸死之前 离开这儿呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't you just leave town? Please, before you blow up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.98,0:17:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.32,0:18:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这儿有事发生 阿瓦 和你我都有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because there's something going on here, Ava.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.99,0:18:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 还有其他跟我们一样的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With you. With me. I mean, there are others like us out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.87,0:18:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都陷入了某种件事中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're all a part of something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.54,0:18:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要搞清楚到底怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I gotta figure out what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.17,0:18:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.71,0:18:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 你见鬼去吧 因为我在皮奥里亚当秘书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you, buddy, okay? Because I'm a secretary from Peoria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.21,0:18:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和其它的事情一点关系都没有 看见这个了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not part of anything. Do you see this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.67,0:18:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过8周我就结婚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am getting married in eight weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该在家里写请柬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to be home addressing invitations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.55,0:18:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,说起来我的进度已经严重落后了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which I'm way behind on, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.52,0:18:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我却开车这么远 来救你这个怪胎的小命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But instead, I drove out here to save your weirdo ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.35,0:18:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你宁可呆在这儿等死 随你的便{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you just wanna stay here and die, fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.23,0:18:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我？我要回到正常人的生活去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, I'm due back on planet Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.36,0:18:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不想知道是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you wanna know why this is happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.20,0:18:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你难道不害怕这些幻觉吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, don't these visions scare the hell out of you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为如果你现在走出门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if you walk out that door right now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可能永远蒙在鼓里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you might never know the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.58,0:18:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.25,0:18:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 威尔逊小姐 你是新来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Miss Wilson, you're new in town?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.05,0:18:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.22,0:19:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么来做心理治疗呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what made you decide to seek out therapy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.34,0:19:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也不知道 - 你不知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have no idea. - No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.14,0:19:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是说 我现在真的觉得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I mean, I'm feeling really super…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.48,0:19:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常… 特别… 不安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}anxious, right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.85,0:19:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有别的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, anything else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.77,0:19:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.94,0:19:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 活见鬼 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Holy crap. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.07,0:19:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚想起来 我小时候吞了 大概8块Pop Rock糖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just remembered when I was a kid, I swallowed eight things of Pop Rocks…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.95,0:19:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,又喝了一整桶可乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and drank a can of Coke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那算是有自杀的倾向吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think that counts as a suicide attempt, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.68,0:19:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.68,0:19:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有没有事？- 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Am I okay? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚帮你 偷了个死人的保密心理档案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just helped you steal some dead guy's confidential psych files.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.68,0:19:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太厉害了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm awesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.40,0:19:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是一年多前开始的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It started a little over a year ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.98,0:19:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是偏头疼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Migraines at first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.98,0:20:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就发现我能干些事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I found that I could do stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.45,0:20:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,「干些事」是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "do stuff"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.28,0:20:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一种能力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have this ability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我想的话 我能电死我所接触的任何东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I touch something, I can electrocute it if I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.43,0:20:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢上帝 你没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God you're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.03,0:20:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 不只是没事 萨姆 你这个小狐狸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're better than okay. Sam, you sly dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.99,0:20:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个黄眼男人还说了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else does the yellow-eyed man say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为我计划好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has plans for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.67,0:20:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,说是会有一场战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says there's a war coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.71,0:21:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我这样的人就会变成战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And people like me, we're gonna be the soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.01,0:21:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都将改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is about to change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.22,0:21:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的人里面不包括我们吧 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not talking about us, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.01,0:21:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.06,0:21:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们如何变成他想要的人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well-But how can we turn into that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.52,0:21:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.90,0:21:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下 上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down. Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.28,0:21:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉我怎么回事？- 趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what's happening! Stay low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.70,0:21:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.38,0:21:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.30,0:21:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么对我弟弟的话 我就杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do that to my brother? I'll kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.60,0:21:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.62,0:22:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 我不太明白 我们为什么不报警呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, I don't understand. Shouldn't we be talking to the cops?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.92,0:22:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 那样做对我们没什么好处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, they wouldn't do us much good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.43,0:22:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是2。-233直径的子弹 亚音速的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are.223 caliber. Subsonic rounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.93,0:22:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙肯定在枪上安装了消声音器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy must have put a suppressor on the rifle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.10,0:22:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.44,0:22:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是… 嗯 经常看T。-J·胡克的节目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I just-I just, uh, watch a lot of T.J. Hooker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.41,0:22:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打电话给谁？- 我哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you calling? - My brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.62,0:22:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we definitely need help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.45,0:22:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈喽？- 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.16,0:22:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆我一直在找你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I've been looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.12,0:23:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我现在在印地安那拉斐特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, look, I'm in Indiana, uh, Lafayette.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.29,0:23:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 你知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know. - You do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.13,0:23:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我找埃伦过了 我自己过来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I talked to Ellen. I just got here myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.63,0:23:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个有趣的小镇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a real funky town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.30,0:23:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甩了我萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ditched me, Sammy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.97,0:23:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 抱歉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.35,0:23:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着 现在有人在跟踪我 什么？- 是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- look, um…right now, there's someone after me. - What? Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.06,0:23:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不清楚 我要你帮我找出是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. That's what we need to find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.14,0:23:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.44,0:23:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在住在门罗路5637号 你过来和我碰个头吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm staying at 5637 Monroe Street. Why don't you meet me here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.02,0:23:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.95,0:23:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样做难吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, was that so hard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.24,0:23:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.95,0:23:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 我哥有麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - My brother's in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.83,0:23:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.54,0:23:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给我了一个暗号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave me a code word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.37,0:23:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人用枪指着他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's got a gun on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.88,0:23:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 暗号？- 是的 有趣的小镇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Code word? - Yeah, funky town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.76,0:23:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he thought of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.59,0:23:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长了 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of a long story. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.01,0:23:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.27,0:24:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我和萨姆不讨你喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know me and Sam aingt exactly your favorite people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.35,0:24:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但… 你也太极端了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't you think this is a little extreme?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.90,0:24:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 你认为这是为了报复吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you think this is revenge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.48,0:24:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是让你绑着 在那推垃圾里面待了三天而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did leave you tied up in your own mess for three days…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.03,0:24:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个不错主意吧 不好意思 我不该笑的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ha-ha, which was awesome. I'm sorry, I shouldn't laugh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.78,0:24:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.70,0:24:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为这事 我是想好好的教训你一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was planning on whupping your ass for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.00,0:24:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但并不是为了这事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what this is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.41,0:24:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是私人恩怨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.04,0:24:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我不是杀手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a killer, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.08,0:24:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是猎手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.50,0:24:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟就是我要猎杀的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your brother's fair game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.55,0:24:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想我不应该离开 - 阿瓦 我不想伤害你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think I should leave. - I want you out of harm's way, Ava.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.43,0:24:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你呢？- 我做的从不是安全的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about you? - Harm's way doesn't really bother me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.60,0:24:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 你现在正照着我的预兆走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but you are walking right into my vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.44,0:24:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样你会死的 - 我不在乎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, this is how you die. - Doesn't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.52,0:24:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要救我哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.23,0:24:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我能帮上忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I can help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.57,0:24:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该做的都做了 只要回到你未婚夫身边就可以了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done all you can. Just-Just go back to your fiancé.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.53,0:24:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.08,0:25:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我肯定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.91,0:25:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家吧 阿瓦 那里是安全的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go home, Ava. You'll be safe there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.42,0:25:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.34,0:25:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证在事办完后 打电话给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}promise me you'll call. When you get your brother…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.26,0:25:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就告诉我一切都没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to let me know that everything's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.93,0:25:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.26,0:25:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在路易斯安那州除了个魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I was doing an exorcism down in Louisiana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.97,0:25:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个十几岁的女孩 看上去没什么特别的 是个低级别的魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teenage girl. Seemed routine, some low-level demon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.35,0:25:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在模糊的话语中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But between the jabbering and head-spinning…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.77,0:25:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个魔鬼提到一些 关于即将到来的战争的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}damn thing muttered something. About a coming war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.19,0:25:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想那话并不是故意的 可能只是一时说漏了 但太晚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it meant to. It just kind of slipped out, but it was too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.11,0:25:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些话已经引起了我的兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Piqued my interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.62,0:25:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你用对了工具 你真的可以和魔鬼沟通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can really make a demon talk, if you got the right tools.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.16,0:25:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个被附身的女孩怎么样了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to the possessed girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.33,0:25:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没有挺过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.46,0:25:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这狗娘养的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're a son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.63,0:25:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准这么说我老妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my mama you're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.80,0:26:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.14,0:26:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那魔鬼告诉我 在即将到的战争中他们会有战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this demon tells me they have soldiers to fight in this coming war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.02,0:26:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类将为魔鬼而战 你相信这些吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans, fighting on hell's side. Do you believe that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.14,0:26:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们能通神 所以已经不是真正的人类了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they're psychics, so they're not exactly pure humans but still-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.48,0:26:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的人会残杀自己的同类啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of worthless scumbag you gotta be to turn against your own race?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.20,0:26:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道最大的发现是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know the biggest kick in the ass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.82,0:26:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔鬼告诉我其中一个还是我认识的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This demon said I knew one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.87,0:26:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我们亲爱的萨姆·温彻斯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our very own Sammy Winchester.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.37,0:26:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这… 真是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.04,0:26:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是傻的不轻啊 就算是你我也这么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a whole new level of moronic, even for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.84,0:26:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.17,0:26:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别装傻了迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.75,0:26:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道有关萨姆能有预兆的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know… about Sam's visions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.22,0:26:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我什么都知道 - 真的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know everything. I know… - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.64,0:26:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔鬼告诉你的？是呀 他们不会说谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because a demon told you? Ha-ha. Yeah, and it wasn't lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.85,0:26:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 迪恩 我可不是在雅虎上随便查查就了事的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean, I'm not some reckless yahoo, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.52,0:26:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做足功课了 我他妈的可以确定这是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did my homework. Made damn sure it was true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.53,0:26:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你可以在罗德豪斯拿到资料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you got your Roadhouse connections…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.70,0:27:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有我的办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.66,0:27:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么 我能第一时间知道萨姆的所在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I found Sammy in the first place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.75,0:27:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个月前 我发现这镇上有个他们的同类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a month ago, I found another one of these freaks, here in town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.29,0:27:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只要一碰谁 谁就会电焦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd deep-fry a person just by touching them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.71,0:27:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 他杀了人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, did he kill anyone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.59,0:27:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 除了丁克斯家的那只猫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides Mr. Tinkles, the cat? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.05,0:27:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但杀人也是迟早的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he was working up to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.05,0:27:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都会变成杀手 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all gonna be killers, Dean. We gotta take them all out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.60,0:27:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把他们全干掉 其中也包括萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that means Sammy too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.11,0:27:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为萨姆会傻乎乎地到从前门直接进来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think Sam's stupid enough to go to the front door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.73,0:27:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没那么想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.78,0:27:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是在你警告他之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially since I'm sure you found a way to warn him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.91,0:27:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为我是傻子吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think I'm that stupid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.08,0:27:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.08,0:27:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆会先看一下这屋子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy's gonna scope the place first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.30,0:27:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到我埋伏在前门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See me covering the front door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.92,0:28:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就会从后门进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's gonna take the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.84,0:28:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他这样做了 他就会绊到那根电线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when he does, he'll hit the tripwire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.10,0:28:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着… 。-{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.10,0:28:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就爆炸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}boom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.73,0:28:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆不会被那个电线绊倒的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's not gonna fall for a frigging tripwire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.44,0:28:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你说的没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.95,0:28:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我做了二手准备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'll have a second one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.62,0:28:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.96,0:28:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.13,0:28:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望我不要那么做 我真的这么想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I didn't have to do this, I really do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.51,0:28:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这样做是值得的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for what it's worth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.63,0:28:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会儿就完事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll be quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.71,0:29:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.72,0:29:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比任何人都了解萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Sam, okay? Better than anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.72,0:29:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他比我有良知的多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got more of a conscience than I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.97,0:29:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙连看色情网站都觉得内疚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy feels guilty surfing Internet for porn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.47,0:29:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.22,0:29:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但有一天他会变成怪兽 - 怎么变？嗯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But one day, he's gonna be a monster. - How? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.02,0:29:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,像萨姆这样的人如何变成怪兽？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does Sam become a monster?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.52,0:29:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 问住我了 不过他肯定会变 - 不 你什么都不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Beats me, but he will. - No, you don't know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.19,0:29:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你的表现表示吃惊 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised at you, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.15,0:29:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么感情用事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting all emotional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.03,0:29:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到的你比现在要专业的多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd heard you were more of a professional than this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.70,0:29:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 就算你独自开车到处跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, let's say you were cruising around in that car of yours…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.96,0:30:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着散弹枪去猎鬼 呃？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, you had little Hitler riding shotgun, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.34,0:30:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他还是个蹩脚的书呆子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back when he was just some goofy, crappy artist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.18,0:30:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道有一天他会变成什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you knew what he was gonna turn into someday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.26,0:30:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须把他干掉 没问题了 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd take him out. No questions. Am I right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.56,0:30:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那不是萨姆 - 他就是那样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not Sam. - Yes, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.39,0:30:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是你还没看出来而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just can't see it yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.61,0:30:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 这是他的命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's his destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.28,0:30:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.78,0:30:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对此我也表示同情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sympathetic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.74,0:30:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你弟弟 你所爱的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's your brother. You love the guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.62,0:30:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样做对你来说会痛不欲生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has gotta hurt like hell for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.71,0:30:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这么说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here's the thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.59,0:30:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来早该灭了他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would've wrecked him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.13,0:30:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有你父亲在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your dad…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.72,0:30:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他必须那么做的话 他肯定也会铁下心来 做我现在做的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it came right down to it, he'd have the stones to do the right thing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.27,0:30:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you telling me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.73,0:31:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成不像了你父亲那样的人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not the man he is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.68,0:32:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.36,0:32:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here he comes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.54,0:32:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.21,0:32:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没完呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.25,0:32:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们等着瞧吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait and see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.57,0:33:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起了 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.39,0:33:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.10,0:33:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该在这里脱鞋子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't take your shoes off around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.47,0:33:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可能会得破伤风的 - 快把枪放下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You might get tetanus. - Put it down now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.44,0:33:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会杀我的 不是吗？萨姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't shoot me, would you, Sammy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.07,0:33:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你哥说你是个圣人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because your brother, he thinks you're some kind of saint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.57,0:34:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但我不能确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Well, I wouldn't be so sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.74,0:34:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到吗 我说的没错吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that's what I said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.85,0:34:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比你猎杀的怪物好不到哪去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're no better than the filthy things you hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.79,0:34:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.88,0:34:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪呀 萨姆让你哥也知道你其实就是个杀手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it! Show your brother the killer you really are, Sammy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.55,0:35:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.92,0:35:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 婊子养的 - 迪恩 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Son of a… - Dean, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.92,0:35:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次就不该饶他 我可不想再饶他一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let him live once. I won't make the same mistake twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.55,0:35:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.60,0:35:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登已经被「搞定」了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon's taken care of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.81,0:35:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.24,0:36:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.46,0:36:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你所谓的「照顾」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call this "taken care of"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.75,0:36:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你到底做了什么？- 相信我吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell are we doing? - Just trust me on this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.43,0:36:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下不的武器 跪下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your weapons. Get down on your knees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.89,0:36:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.48,0:36:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,双手放在头上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands above your head now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.60,0:36:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在跪在地上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the ground, right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.77,0:36:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.11,0:36:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手放在你的头上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands on your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.78,0:36:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在放松{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.26,0:37:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个 看看这个 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this. Look at this, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.01,0:37:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,匿名举报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anonymous tip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.01,0:37:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你真是个「又好又出色的」市民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a fine, upstanding citizen, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.74,0:37:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戈登猎杀萨姆？- 他差点杀了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gordon Walker was hunting Sam? - He almost killed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.49,0:37:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你那里的人就不能闭上嘴少说话吗？- 你真以为是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Somebody can't keep her mouth shut. - And you honestly think it was me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.50,0:37:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿什或是乔出卖了你们？这不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Ash, or Jo? No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.17,0:37:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆的事还有谁知道 嗯？你肯定和谁说过我们的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else knows about Sam, huh? You must've been talking to somebody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.00,0:37:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以说我们如何不好 但我们知道什么是诚实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can say a lot of things about us, but we aren't disloyal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.34,0:37:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们也不是白痴 也从来提都没提过这事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're not stupid. We haven't breathed a word of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.47,0:37:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃伦 戈登说他在罗德豪斯也有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon said he had Roadhouse connections.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.81,0:37:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但罗德豪斯里还有很多其它的捕猎者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this roadhouse is full of other hunters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.02,0:37:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也不笨 他们也是不错的猎捕者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all smart, they're good trackers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.69,0:38:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个都有他们的搭挡和消息来源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}each of them with their own patterns and connections.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.07,0:38:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就可以说出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I could name 12 of them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.78,0:38:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一打能打听到这事的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}right now that are capable of putting this together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.86,0:38:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,对发生的一切我表示抱歉 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry about what happened, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.91,0:38:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不能左右这些人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't control these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.12,0:38:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他们的思想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what they choose to believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.04,0:38:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 阿瓦 还是我 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Ava. It's Sam again, um.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.21,0:38:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果听到我的留言请回我电话 只是想确认你已经到家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me when you get this. Just wanna make sure you got home okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.13,0:38:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.93,0:38:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.10,0:38:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I hope so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.35,0:38:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登肯定要在里面至少蹲上几年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Gordon should be reaching for the soap for the next few years at least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.60,0:38:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 如果斯科特·凯里的死也算在他头上的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.If they pin Scott Carey's murder on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.48,0:38:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就别想出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he doesn't bust out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.11,0:38:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 以后别再这样做了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, if you ever take off like that again…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.11,0:38:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.78,0:38:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要杀了我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll kill me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.37,0:38:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那可一点也不好笑 - 知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's so not funny. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.75,0:39:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 那下一站去哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so where to next then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.92,0:39:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个词 阿姆斯特丹 - 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One word. Amsterdam. - Dean{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.35,0:39:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说那里的咖啡店都没咖啡卖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear the coffee shops don't even serve coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.76,0:39:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可不想放下工作 - 去他的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not gonna just ditch the job. - Screw the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.09,0:39:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他的 我已经对这工作厌倦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw it. I'm sick of the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.84,0:39:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,干这又没钱拿 又没人谢我们 唯一得到的就是坏运气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't get paid, we don't get thanked. Only thing we get's bad luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.56,0:39:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 你是个猎手 你以前不是一直这样认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, come on, dude. You're a hunter. It's what you were meant to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.27,0:39:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不相信什么命运的鬼话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't meant to do anything. I don't believe in that crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.52,0:39:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你不相信我的命运？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean you don't believe in my destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.69,0:39:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你的便{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.11,0:39:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 迪恩 以前我一直想逃避{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Dean, I've tried running before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.61,0:39:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我逃到加利福尼亚 你看又发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran all the way to California, and look what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.78,0:39:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能就这样逃避 这样也保护不了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't run from this. And you can't protect me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.91,0:39:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以试一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.96,0:39:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.59,0:39:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 迪恩 我还要继续猎捕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Dean, I'm gonna keep hunting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.51,0:39:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管接着会发生什么 我都会义无反顾的去做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, whatever is coming, I'm taking it head-on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.43,0:39:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真想照顾我的话 那你就要跟紧一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you really want to watch my back, I guess you'll have to stick around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.81,0:40:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贱人 - 怪胎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bitch. - Jerk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.11,0:40:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,又打电话给那个叫阿瓦的女孩？你和他有暧昧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're calling that Ava girl again? Are you sweet on her or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.49,0:40:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她已经订婚了 迪恩 - 所以… ？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's engaged, Dean. - So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.12,0:40:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键在于你要想拯救世界 就一刻也不能闲？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the point of saving the world if you can't get a little nookie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.42,0:40:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.33,0:40:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有不详的感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.46,0:40:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里离皮奥里亚有多远？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far is it to Peoria?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.27,0:40:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈喽？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.60,0:40:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在家吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anybody home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.49,0:41:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.09,0:41:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.39,0:41:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,硫磺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sulphur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.40,0:41:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有魔鬼来过这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon's been here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.50,0:41:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿瓦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ava.{\r}
